{"sha": "0cb947344eb4db78876caffaa2a72034b883a67466207dd2aea95da7b24bab22", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "    width=9.6cm, height=6.2cm, xmin=0, xmax=5.4, ymin=0, ymax=2.6,", "    xlabel={$k$}, ylabel={$E$},", "    xlabel style={at={(axis description cs:0.5,-0.1)}, anchor=north},", "    xtick={3.1416}, xticklabels={$\\pi/a$}, ytick=\\empty, clip=true]", "    % free-electron parabola (dashed)", "    \\addplot[gray, dashed, domain=0:5.1, samples=120] {x*x/10};", "    % lower band: bends flat at zone edge", "    \\addplot[omDef, very thick, domain=0:3.1416, samples=120]", "      {x*x/10 - 0.18*(x/3.1416)^6};", "    % upper band", "    \\addplot[omDef, very thick, domain=3.1416:5.1, samples=120]", "      {x*x/10 + 0.18*((5.1-x)/1.9584)^2};", "    \\draw[gray, dashed] (axis cs:3.1416,0) -- (axis cs:3.1416,2.55);", "    % gap markers", "    \\draw[omThm, thick, <->] (axis cs:3.2,0.81) -- (axis cs:3.2,1.16);", "    \\node[omThm, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:3.34,0.98)", "      {带隙 $E_{\\text{g}}$};", "    \\node[gray, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north west, align=left]", "      at (axis cs:0.35,2.45) {虚线：自由电子};", "    \\node[omDef, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=east] at (axis cs:2.75,0.35)", "      {能带 1};", "    \\node[omDef, font=\\scriptsize, anchor=west] at (axis cs:3.6,2.35)", "      {能带 2};", "  \\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 近自由电子。远离布里渊区边界时，电子", "几乎感觉不到晶格的存在；在 $k = \\pi/a$ 处，电子自身的布拉格", "反射将抛物线劈开，禁止带隙中的能量。", "声波在上一章中正是如此 --- 同样的晶格，同样的干涉，", "只是换了个新“住户”。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{definition}[金属、绝缘体、半导体]\\label{def:b3:electrons-in-solids:classes}", "\\index{金属}\\index{绝缘体}\\index{半导体}", "将晶体的电子填入能带，每个态两个电子", "（见\\cref{ch:b3:identical-particles}），由最低能级开始填充。若最上方被占据的能带", "是\\emph{部分}填充的，则极小的能量可使", "电子产生净运动：这便是\\emph{金属}（钠：一个", "价电子，半个能带；二价金属借", "能带交叠导电）。若能带\\emph{恰好}被填满，且上方带隙很宽，", "则任何微小的推动都无法重排任何电子：这便是\\emph{绝缘体}", "（金刚石，$E_{\\text{g}} = \\qty{5.5}{eV}$）。若带隙较小 ---", "如硅中的 $\\qty{1.12}{eV}$ --- 热运动把少量", "电子推过带隙，并在其下方留下一个可移动的\\emph{空穴}：", "此即\\emph{半导体}，其载流子数", "$\\propto\\eu^{-E_{\\text{g}}/2k_{\\text{B}}T}$ 每隔", "数度便翻一番。于是二者截然相反：金属受热时导电变差", "（需散射的振动增多），半导体则导电变好", "（载流子按指数规律增多）--- 仅一次符号翻转，便可", "在一次测量中辨别材料的类别。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.0]", "  % metal: half-filled band", "  \\begin{scope}", "    \\fill[omDef!25] (0,0) rectangle (1.8,0.8);", "    \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (1.8,1.6);", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north] at (0.9,-0.15) {金属};", "    \\node[font=\\tiny, anchor=south] at (0.9,1.65) {部分填充};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % insulator", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=3.6cm]", "    \\fill[omDef!25] (0,0) rectangle (1.8,0.9);", "    \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (1.8,0.9);", "    \\draw[thick] (0,2.1) rectangle (1.8,2.9);", "    \\draw[omThm, thick, <->] (2.05,0.9) -- (2.05,2.1);", "    \\node[omThm, font=\\tiny, anchor=west] at (2.12,1.5)", "      {$E_{\\text{g}} \\sim \\qty{5}{eV}$};", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north] at (0.9,-0.15) {绝缘体};", "    \\node[font=\\tiny, anchor=south] at (0.9,2.95) {空带};", "  \\end{scope}", "  % semiconductor", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=8.4cm]", "    \\fill[omDef!25] (0,0) rectangle (1.8,0.9);", "    \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (1.8,0.9);", "    \\draw[thick] (0,1.5) rectangle (1.8,2.3);", "    \\draw[omThm, thick, <->] (2.05,0.9) -- (2.05,1.5);", "    \\node[omThm, font=\\tiny, anchor=west] at (2.12,1.2)", "      {$\\sim\\qty{1}{eV}$};", "    % thermally excited carriers", "    \\fill[omThm] (0.5,1.62) circle (1.6pt);", "    \\fill[omThm] (1.25,1.62) circle (1.6pt);", "    \\draw[omThm] (0.5,0.78) circle (1.6pt);", "    \\draw[omThm] (1.25,0.78) circle (1.6pt);", "    \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north] at (0.9,-0.15) {半导体};", "    \\node[font=\\tiny, anchor=south] at (0.9,2.35)", "      {少量电子 $+$ 空穴};", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 能带的填充情况决定一切。部分填充的能带可导电；", "上方带隙很宽的满带则不能；窄带隙则允许", "温度（或光，或掺杂）介入其中 --- 半导体的全部价值", "在于其导电能力是\\emph{可调}的。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{带隙工程：掺杂与结}", "", "\\begin{definition}[掺杂]\\label{def:b3:electrons-in-solids:doping}", "\\index{掺杂}\\index{施主}\\index{受主}\\index{空穴}", "将百万个硅原子中的一个替换为磷（五个价电子）：", "四个键已饱和，第五个电子", "束缚极弱，仅为 \\qty{45}{meV}", "（见\\cref{exo:b3:electrons-in-solids:10}），在室温下", "即可成为自由电子。这类\\emph{施主}形成", "\\emph{n 型}半导体，以电子导电；硼（三个价电子）", "则是\\emph{受主}，俘获一个成键电子，并释放出一个", "可移动的\\emph{空穴} --- 它是一个缺失的电子，能够移动、响应外场，", "并且携带正电荷，其真实程度正如气泡之于", "浮力：这便是\\emph{p 型}。掺杂使载流子密度", "--- 进而电导率 --- 可随意在六个数量级之间摆动：", "这便是将沙子变为电路的旋钮。", "\\end{definition}", ""]}